# macOS custom folder icon file, which is literally named "Icon\r".
# The line below is "Icon" + TWO carriage returns (git strips one trailing CR),
# and editors may silently delete them. Do NOT "simplify" it to "Icon?": on
# case-insensitive macOS that also matched our icons/ folders, so new icons
# were silently left out of git and missing from deploys.
Icon

unused
